Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.54,0:00:16.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,科幻类
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.35,0:00:29.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么我可以效劳的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.74,0:00:32.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  德扬探员和萧探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure hope so. agents Deyoung and Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.16,0:00:33.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就问几个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just need to ask you a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.50,0:00:36.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近几天楼里有什么怪事发生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Notice anything strange in the building,last couple of days?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.38,0:00:37.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.07,0:00:39.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有住户反应电灯闪烁之类的事么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,some other tenants reported flickering lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.45,0:00:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so. why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.01,0:00:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有奇怪的声音吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about noises?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.01,0:00:45.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是老鼠在墙里跑来跑去那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any skittering in the walls? kind of like rats?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:48.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,联邦探员也调查鼠害吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the FBI is investigating a rodent problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.78,0:00:50.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那有没有骤冷的情况吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about cold spots?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.21,0:00:52.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感到温度突然下降之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel any sudden drops in temperature?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:55.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.44,0:00:58.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在玩LARP吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are larping, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.08,0:00:59.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你说什么  -你们是粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me? - you're fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.32,0:01:01.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么粉丝  -LARP是啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fans of what? - What is "larping"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.30,0:01:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别装了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.88,0:01:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真人角色扮演啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live-action role-playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.67,0:01:09.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来你们相当专业\N{\fnArial\fs30}And pretty hardcore,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.42,0:01:11.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.05,0:01:14.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们问的这些问题就好像这楼里闹鬼似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're asking questions like the building's haunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.35,0:01:15.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像书里的角色一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like those guys from the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.98,0:01:17.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那书叫什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they called?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.49,0:01:19.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《凶鬼恶灵》\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Supernatural."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:24.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个男人  伪造身份  用不同的化名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two guys,use fake i.d.s with rock aliases,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.76,0:01:27.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在全国各地狩猎鬼魂  恶魔和吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunt down ghosts, demons,vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.69,0:01:28.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们叫什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are their names?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.55,0:01:31.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯蒂文和德克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steve and Dirk?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.25,0:01:33.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是萨尔和戴恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sal and Dane?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.42,0:01:37.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是萨姆和迪恩吗  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam and Dean? - that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.69,0:01:39.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说有写这些的这么一本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying this is a book?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.14,0:01:41.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是一本  是一系列\N{\fnArial\fs30}Books. it was a series.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.97,0:01:43.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然卖得不怎么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't sell a lot of copies, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:47.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过忠粉还是很有很多的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of had more of an underground-cult following.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.31,0:01:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找找看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.27,0:01:54.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.41,0:01:56.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想这是第一本\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the first one, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.13,0:01:57.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特价区
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.10,0:02:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《凶鬼恶灵》  作者是卡文·爱德路德\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Supernatural" by Carver Edlund.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.36,0:02:01.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《凶鬼恶灵》\N{\fnArial\fs30}加州高速公路上一个穿白衣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}孤身女人诱惑花心男人再杀之...\N{\fnArial\fs30}这一恐怖是事件却是\N{\fnArial\fs30}萨姆和迪恩找到父亲的首要线索
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.47,0:02:03.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在空寂的加州高速路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}"along a lonely california highway,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.30,0:02:06.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个神秘的白衣女子诱惑男人  走向死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mysterious woman in white lures men to their deaths."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.20,0:02:07.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.73,0:02:14.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这儿有的这套《凶鬼恶灵》  我们全要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need all the copies of "supernatural you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.07,0:02:22.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第4季第18集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.59,0:02:27.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,未知的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Monster At The End Of This Book
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.68,0:02:35.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真是太诡异了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is freakin' insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.95,0:02:37.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这作家怎么会知道这些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's this guy know all this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.48,0:02:38.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你问住我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.29,0:02:40.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,书中的每一件事儿  注意了是每一件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is in here -- I mean everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.28,0:02:42.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从那辆种族歧视的卡车(S01E13)  到我上床的细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the racist truck to -- to me having sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.78,0:02:44.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我简直就是赤裸裸地在这儿让别人参观\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm full-frontal in here, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.43,0:02:47.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么以前没听说过呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come we haven't heard of them before?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:48.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们相当地低调\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're pretty obscure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.72,0:02:50.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这书几乎算不上是上市发行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, almost zero circulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.08,0:02:52.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从05年就开始发行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Started in '05.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.31,0:02:55.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出版商出版了一些之后  就破产了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The publisher put out a couple dozen before going bankrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.33,0:02:59.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后一本是《邪恶无终止》(S03E16)\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, the last one -- "no rest for the wicked"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.92,0:03:01.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结局就是你坠入了地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ends with you going to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.59,0:03:03.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不得不重申\N{\fnArial\fs30}I reiterate
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:05.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太诡异了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freakin' insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.64,0:03:07.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,噢  瞧瞧  还真的是有粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out. there's actually fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.78,0:03:10.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-人虽然不多  你看过了吗  -看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not many,but still. did you read this? - yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.45,0:03:12.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,粉丝的意见还挺多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although for fans, they sure do complain a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.29,0:03:12.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to this
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.79,0:03:16.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辛派提可说  恶魔的故事太老套了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simpatico says "the demon story line is trite, cliched,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.69,0:03:18.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总得来说就是很无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And overall craptastic."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.70,0:03:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  去你的吧  辛派提可  这可是我们的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, screw you, Simpatico. we lived it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.53,0:03:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  接着往下看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. well,keep on reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.39,0:03:24.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有更赞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It gets better.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.55,0:03:27.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还有《萨姆女版》和《迪恩女版》\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are "Sam girls" and "Dean girls" and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.93,0:03:29.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同人迷是啥东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's a "Slash Fan"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.66,0:03:30.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.26,0:03:32.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆同迪恩(鞭挞小说, 描写同性恋者)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam-slash-Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.62,0:03:34.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.84,0:03:39.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像情侣那样么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, together together?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:40.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.92,0:03:43.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们知道我们是兄弟吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do know we're brothers,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.27,0:03:44.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那根本无足挂齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't seem to matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.25,0:03:46.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. that...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.87,0:03:48.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也太变态了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.18,0:03:51.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要把这个卡文·爱德路德找出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to find this Carver Edlund.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.79,0:03:53.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-可能不容易  -为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah,that might not be so easy. - why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:56.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有税务记录  没有地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}No tax records, no known address.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.54,0:03:58.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡文·爱德路德应该是个笔名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like "Carver Edlund" is a pen name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.96,0:04:00.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定有人知道他的真实身份吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's got to know who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.10,0:04:04.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你就是《凶鬼恶灵》的出版商\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you published the "Supernatural" books?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.92,0:04:07.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  天哪  这些书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. yeah. Gosh. these books...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.51,0:04:10.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们居然得不到应有的重视\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,they never really got the attention they deserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.98,0:04:13.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们都只想看那些讲狗屁爱情的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}All anybody wants to read anymore is that romance crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.18,0:04:17.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像性感医生那种  真是够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know -- "doctor sexy,M.D."? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.44,0:04:17.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.85,0:04:19.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就是希望我们的小说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,we're hoping that our article
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.06,0:04:23.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能够重获重视  备受瞩目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can shine a light on an underappreciated series.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.09,0:04:24.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,yeah, because,you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.67,0:04:26.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们能好好地做下宣传\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we got a little bit of good press,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.05,0:04:27.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许就能再次发行出版了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then m-maybe we could start publishing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.41,0:04:28.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  天哪  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no,no,no. god, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.79,0:04:31.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想问你  为什么你会那么想出版他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,why -- why would you want to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.33,0:04:34.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它不是已经完结了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's, uh, such a complete series,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:37.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩不是已经坠入地狱了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What with Dean going to hell and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.09,0:04:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  我最爱的就是这个情节了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,my god! that was one of my favorite ones,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.01,0:04:41.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩他是那么  坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because dean was so... strong
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:43.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么忧伤和勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sad and brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.68,0:04:44.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Sam
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.41,0:04:47.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最最大爱的就是他们落泪的那一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,the best parts are when they'd cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.61,0:04:49.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如《心之归属》(S02E17)里面写到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, like in -- in "heart,"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.71,0:04:51.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当萨姆不得不杀掉麦迪逊那一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Sam had to kill Madison,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.57,0:04:54.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是杰西卡死后第一个他真正爱上的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first woman since Jessica he really loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.42,0:04:57.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有《回家》(S01E09)那一本  迪恩不得不给约翰打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in "Home," when Dean had to call John
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.20,0:04:58.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向他求助那一幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}And ask him for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.35,0:04:59.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.54,0:05:02.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gosh
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:04.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果现实中有男人也能如此流露\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only real men were so open
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.93,0:05:06.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,表露他们的真实感情的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in -- in touch with their feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.57,0:05:07.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real men?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.11,0:05:10.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要介意  我只是想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,no offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.26,0:05:12.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你几时有像那样伤心地痛哭过\N{\fnArial\fs30}How often do you cry like that,hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.07,0:05:14.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  此刻我内心就正痛哭流涕着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,right now, I'm crying on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.77,0:05:17.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得那很滑稽吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that supposed to be funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.37,0:05:18.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美女  这根本就太扯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady,this whole thing is funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.16,0:05:23.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么知道你们是不是真有诚意呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I know you two are legit,hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.64,0:05:25.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.33,0:05:27.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们很有  诚意\N{\fnArial\fs30}We,uh... we're legit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.47,0:05:28.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想让某些自以为是的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't want any smart-ass article
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.93,0:05:30.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟蹋我家两小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making fun of my boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.02,0:05:31.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 不  绝不会  -不会的 其实...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! no,no. never. - no,that's
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.70,0:05:33.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们...我们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We--we are actually
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.97,0:05:36.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超级粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.50,0:05:38.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说你们也读过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've read the books?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.54,0:05:39.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从头至尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover to cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.96,0:05:41.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那辆车的年代和型号\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the year and model of the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.19,0:05:43.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1967年的雪佛兰黑羚羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}1967 Chevy Impala.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.10,0:05:44.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-5月2日是  -那是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's may 2nd? - that's my...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.50,0:05:47.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是萨姆的生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Sam's birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.79,0:05:49.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩的生日是1月24日\N{\fnArial\fs30}January 24th is Dean's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.47,0:05:50.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆在法学院入学考试的分数是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's score on the lsat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.69,0:05:53.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一百\N{\fnArial\fs30}1...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.20,0:05:56.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七十四分\N{\fnArial\fs30}74?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:05:59.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩最喜欢的歌是  -真是很纠结啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean's favorite song? - It's a tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.42,0:06:01.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,齐柏林飞艇的《漫谈》和\N{\fnArial\fs30}Between zep's "Ramble On" 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.56,0:06:03.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《沿江蓝调》两首都爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And "Traveling Riverside Blues."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.38,0:06:08.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.54,0:06:09.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.28,0:06:11.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡文·爱德路德的真名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's Carver Edlund's real name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.87,0:06:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行  抱歉  我不能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,no. no. sorry. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.67,0:06:14.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只想和他谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just want to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.76,0:06:17.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是想和他本人交流下《凶鬼恶灵》的那些事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,get the "supernatural" story in his own words.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.22,0:06:18.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他很避世的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's very private.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.53,0:06:19.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像J.D.塞林格一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like salinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.13,0:06:22.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.80,0:06:24.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正如我所说  我们可是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said - we are...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.85,0:06:27.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超级\N{\fnArial\fs30}...big...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.63,0:06:30.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超级粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}...big fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.83,0:06:39.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太赞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.82,0:06:42.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.05,0:06:48.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got one,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.09,0:06:51.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是个狂热份子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.11,0:06:55.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.41,0:06:56.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的名字叫恰克·舒尔利\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name's Chuck Shurley.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.71,0:06:58.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他可是个天才  所以别把他惹毛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's a genius, so don't piss him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.84,0:07:15.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆和迪恩走近破旧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sam and Dean approached the run-down..."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.67,0:07:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怀揣着不安地走近那遥遥欲坠的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Approached the ramshackle house with trepidation."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:28.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们真得想要揭开那\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Did they really want to learn the secrets
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.68,0:07:31.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,禁闭房门背后的秘密吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"That lay beyond that door?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.49,0:07:35.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆和迪恩意味深长地交换了下眼神\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean traded soulful looks."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.73,0:07:40.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便  下定了决心\N{\fnArial\fs30}"then, with determination,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.82,0:07:45.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩摁下门铃  相当地\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dean pushed the doorbell with forceful...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:47.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笃定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Determination."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.99,0:07:56.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是恰克·舒尔利吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You Chuck Shurley?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.29,0:07:58.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,写《凶鬼恶灵》的恰克·舒尔利吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Chuck Shurley who wrote the "Supernatural" books?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.30,0:08:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算是吧  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe. why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.07,0:08:03.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是迪恩  这是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dean. this is Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.65,0:08:05.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你笔下的迪恩和萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dean and Sam you've been writing about.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.03,0:08:13.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.37,0:08:17.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很感激你们的热情支持  真的  我很感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate your enthusiasm. really,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.25,0:08:19.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有粉丝来拜访这真的太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh, it's always nice to hear from the fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.16,0:08:20.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  为了你们自己好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, for your own good,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.65,0:08:22.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我强烈建议你们做点别的有益的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I strongly suggest you get a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:25.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, here's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.37,0:08:26.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.95,0:08:28.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都在你书中历历在目\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been using it to write your books.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.56,0:08:31.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  这可不一点也不好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, wait a minute. now, this isn't funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.25,0:08:32.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对是他妈的不是玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn straight, it's not funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.66,0:08:34.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只想知道你是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,we just want to know how you're doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.30,0:08:35.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么也没干过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.16,0:08:36.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你是个猎鬼者吗  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you a hunter? - what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.69,0:08:37.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我就只是个作家\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm a writer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.92,0:08:39.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你怎么那么了解魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how do you know so much about demons
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.91,0:08:41.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有西藏灵魂印记(S01E17)和魔童(S03E02)\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Tulpas and Changelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.65,0:08:43.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是在模仿《战栗游戏》(斯蒂芬·金的小说)是不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this some kind of "Misery" thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.63,0:08:45.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错吧  就是在模仿《战栗游戏》\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is, isn't it? it's a "Misery" thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:48.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟《战栗游戏》可没关系  听清楚了  我们不是你粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a "misery" thing. believe me,we are not fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.16,0:08:49.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,then, what do you want?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.24,0:08:51.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是萨姆  这是迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sam. and that's Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.33,0:08:53.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆和迪恩是虚构的人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam and Dean are fictional characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.19,0:08:55.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我创造了他们  他们不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made them up! they're not real!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.08,0:08:59.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都是真枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are those real guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.18,0:09:04.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是真的盐弹和真的假身份证\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is real rock salt and these are real fake I.D.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.76,0:09:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真是服了你们俩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got to hand it to you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.01,0:09:10.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们绝对是我的头号粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really are my number-one fans.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.93,0:09:13.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太强悍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.62,0:09:16.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我想我屋里还有些海报\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I-I think I've got some posters in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.49,0:09:17.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-恰克  站住  -等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Chuck,stop. - Please wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.61,0:09:18.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请不要伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please,don't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.51,0:09:19.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你究竟知道多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.22,0:09:21.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使的事你也知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know about the Angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.65,0:09:23.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有莉莉丝打破封印的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Lilith breaking the seals?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.19,0:09:24.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你们怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. how do you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.55,0:09:25.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是问  你怎么会知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The question is, how do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:27.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为是我写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I wrote it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.18,0:09:28.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还在写吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kept writing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.17,0:09:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  不过出版商破产之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,even after the publisher went bankrupt,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.01,0:09:31.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来的部分就没有出版\N{\fnArial\fs30}But those books never came out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.85,0:09:35.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.32,0:09:36.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是在开玩笑  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is some kind of joke, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.59,0:09:39.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  费尔叫你们来这么干的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did that -- did Phil put you up to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.20,0:09:40.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.92,0:09:43.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是迪恩·温切斯特  这是我弟弟萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dean winchester, and this is my brother, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.11,0:09:47.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没在书中提过姓氏\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last names were never in the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.60,0:09:51.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也没和任何人说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never told anybody about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.50,0:09:52.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,甚至就没写下来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never even write it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:02.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们还在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! oh,you're still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.59,0:10:03.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.29,0:10:04.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不是我的幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a hallucination.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.62,0:10:05.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.02,0:10:08.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么只有一个解释了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's only one explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.39,0:10:10.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很明显我就是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously I'm a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.52,0:10:11.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.86,0:10:13.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然要怎么解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}How else do you explain it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.28,0:10:15.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我笔下的角色  居然成真了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I write things and then they come to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.43,0:10:17.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吧  我绝对是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, I'm definitely a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.26,0:10:20.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是一个残酷  而善变的神\N{\fnArial\fs30}A cruel, cruel, capricious god.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.32,0:10:22.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你们经历的那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}The things I put you through
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.09,0:10:24.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肉体上的折磨\N{\fnArial\fs30}The physical beatings alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:25.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但我们还是完整无缺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,we're still in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.80,0:10:26.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我杀了你们的老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.30,0:10:28.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还活焚了你们老妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I burned your mother alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.53,0:10:30.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后你又再次经历了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you had to go through
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.52,0:10:32.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生在杰西卡身上的同样的悲剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole horrific deal again with Jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.83,0:10:33.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:34.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都是为了啥啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.20,0:10:36.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是为了更富戏剧性\N{\fnArial\fs30}All for the sake of literary symmetry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.58,0:10:40.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我玩弄了你们的命运  你们的情感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I toyed with your lives, your emotions,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.69,0:10:42.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了娱乐大众\N{\fnArial\fs30}For...entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.96,0:10:44.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你并没有玩弄我们  恰克  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't toy with us, Chuck,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.89,0:10:46.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更没有创造我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't create us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.65,0:10:49.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们真的躲过了那些虫子(S01E08)\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you really have to live through the bugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.32,0:10:51.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.48,0:10:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幽灵船(S03E06)也是真的咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the ghost ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.71,0:10:54.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.10,0:10:56.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.74,0:10:58.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,制作恐惧是一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, horror is one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.13,0:11:00.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是要被迫活在恐惧中\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to be forced to live bad writing...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.45,0:11:03.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我知道这会成真的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If i would have known it was real,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.83,0:11:05.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定不会让你们经历那一切的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have done another pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.21,0:11:06.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恰克  你不是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck, you're not a god!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.56,0:11:08.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们觉得你可能会通灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}We think you're probably just psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.96,0:11:09.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.71,0:11:12.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我能通灵的话  我还写作干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I were psychic, you think I'd be writing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.66,0:11:14.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,写作可痛苦着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Writing is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.81,0:11:16.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但冥冥之中  你就像是在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems that somehow, you're just...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.02,0:11:18.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关注着我们的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Focused on our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.61,0:11:20.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  就像远距离偷窥一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,like laser-focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.46,0:11:22.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在还在创作吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you working on anything right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.94,0:11:26.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.13,0:11:27.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.59,0:11:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后一本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}The,uh,latest book.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.25,0:11:34.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点怪异\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's,uh, it's kind of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.98,0:11:36.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么个怪异法\N{\fnArial\fs30}"weird" how?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.93,0:11:38.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太像冯内古特的作品了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very Vonnegut.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.28,0:11:41.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是写《五号屠宰场》和《猫的摇篮》那个冯内古特吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"slaughterhouse-five," or "cat's cradle", Vonnegut
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.44,0:11:43.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你居然知道  -怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.44,0:11:48.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是冯内古特笔下的《基尔戈·特劳特》才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's,uh, "kilgore trout," vonnegut.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.77,0:11:50.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把自己写进了书里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wrote myself into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:54.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,写道  我在自己家中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wrote myself, at my house...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.86,0:11:57.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和笔下创作出的人物面对面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confronted by my characters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.98,0:12:06.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我坐在自助洗衣店\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sitting in a laundromat,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.12,0:12:08.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,读着  我坐在洗衣店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reading about myself sitting in a laundromat,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.01,0:12:09.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,读到我自己  我头都绕疼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reading about myself -- my head hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.97,0:12:11.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙一定有些事没告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's got to be something this guy's not telling us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.30,0:12:17.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆把那一大捆脏衣服扔进洗衣机\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sam tossed his gigantic darks into the machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.42,0:12:19.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始怀疑起恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}"He was starting to have doubts about Chuck,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.14,0:12:21.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是否把所有真相都说了出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}About whether he was telling the whole truth."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.34,0:12:23.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-别读了  -"别读了"  萨姆说道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop it. - "'Stop it,' Sam said."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.49,0:12:25.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猜猜你下步要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess what you do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.54,0:12:30.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆转身背对着迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Sam turned his back on Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.63,0:12:32.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的脸色  阴沉而郁闷\N{\fnArial\fs30}His face, brooding and pensive."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.08,0:12:33.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白他是怎么办到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,I don't know how he's doing it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.99,0:12:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他的确写中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this guy is doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.12,0:12:36.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看不到你的脸  但肯定是写对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see your face, but those are definitely
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.58,0:12:38.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看你那阴沉而郁闷的香肩就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your "brooding and pensive" shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.16,0:12:42.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚在心里骂我混蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just thought I was a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.26,0:12:48.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他确实挺牛的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.04,0:13:32.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又写了一段\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wrote another chapter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.13,0:13:34.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你们出现之前  写这东西真是轻松多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was all so much easier before you were real.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.82,0:13:36.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们抗得住  就直说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can take it. just spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.85,0:13:39.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是你肯定不想听\N{\fnArial\fs30}You especially are not gonna like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.77,0:13:41.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我更不喜欢地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't like hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.24,0:13:44.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟莉莉丝有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.10,0:13:47.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会来找萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's coming for Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.44,0:13:50.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来杀他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming to kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.89,0:13:51.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.42,0:13:53.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.34,0:13:57.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她就这么现身吗  就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's just gonna show up? here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.96,0:14:04.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝充满诱惑性地拍了拍床\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Lilith patted the bed seductively.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.73,0:14:07.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆向自己的欲望屈服了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Unable to deny his desire, Sam succumbed,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.64,0:14:10.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们便陷入了恶魔的激情欲火之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they sank into the throes of fiery demonic passion."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.44,0:14:16.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我开玩笑的  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding me,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.65,0:14:18.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你觉得这很好笑吗  -难道不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think this is funny? - you don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.20,0:14:19.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  老哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,come on. Dude
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.77,0:14:21.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔的激情欲火\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Fiery demonic passion"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.56,0:14:22.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还只是个初稿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a first draft.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.85,0:14:25.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等会儿  莉莉丝不是个小女孩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait,wait,wait,wait. Lilith is a little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.86,0:14:29.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  这次她是一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,uh, this time she's a --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.37,0:14:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来自印第安纳州布卢明顿的漂亮的牙科医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Comely dental hygienist from Bloomington, Indiana."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.55,0:14:34.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.18,0:14:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来呢  在\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what happens after the...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.31,0:14:39.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那恶魔激情什么的  之后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Fiery demonic" whatever?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.20,0:14:42.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道  还没任何征兆呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. that hasn't come to me yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.25,0:14:44.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  没什么好担心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, look, there's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.25,0:14:47.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝和我  还上床\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith and me? in bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.55,0:14:50.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的通灵能力是怎么给你征兆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does this whole psychic thing of yours work?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.25,0:14:51.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是问整个流程吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean my process?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.90,0:14:53.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  你的整个流程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,your "process."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.47,0:14:56.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通常是由一阵头痛开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,it usually starts with a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.53,0:14:58.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常剧烈的头痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}A really bad headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.61,0:15:01.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿司匹林都不管用  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aspirin is useless, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.44,0:15:02.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才一直喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.73,0:15:04.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到入睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until I fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:05.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第一次时\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first time it happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.47,0:15:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为那只是个疯狂的梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was just a crazy dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.01,0:15:08.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是梦到我们的第一次吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first time you dreamt about us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.52,0:15:11.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,画面不停地变换  一直变换着\N{\fnArial\fs30}It flowed. it just -- it kept flowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:14.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直都这样  我根本无法控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still does. I-I can't stop it,really.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.42,0:15:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会真的相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't seriously believe --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.91,0:15:16.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humor me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.21,0:15:21.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我们不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we, we just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:29.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先看看  再做决定之后的事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look at these and see what's what.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.21,0:15:31.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.49,0:15:34.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  我知道你会要那些稿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}...knew you were gonna ask for that. yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.03,0:15:38.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean,come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.06,0:15:41.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小货车的撞击虽不严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The minivan accident wasn't that bad,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.23,0:15:43.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是迪恩还是有点儿眼冒金星\N{\fnArial\fs30}"But Dean was still seeing stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.77,0:15:47.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他茫然地抓下脸上那些带粉色小花的创口贴\N{\fnArial\fs30}"He scratched absently at the pink-flower band-aids on his face."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.88,0:15:49.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.32,0:15:50.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我见过你鲜血四溅\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I've seen you gushing blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.69,0:15:52.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你宁可缠着胶带或破布条\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd use duct tape and bar rags
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.68,0:15:54.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也绝不会贴带粉色小花的创口贴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you'd put on a pink-flower band-aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.86,0:15:57.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你到底想说啥  -我想说的是  这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's your point? my point is this -- all of this --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.38,0:15:59.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本就不可能的 就是胡扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-is totally implausible. it's nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.58,0:16:00.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迄今为止他写的所有事全都发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been right about everything so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.00,0:16:03.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这会是一早就设计好了的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he's just gonna ground out at first now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.50,0:16:07.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩最钟爱的黑斑羚  后窗玻璃支离破碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dean slid behind the wheel of his beloved Impala
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.88,0:16:08.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩气得绝尘而去\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And drove off,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.79,0:16:10.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而后窗上挂着的那块油布\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The plastic tarp on the rear window
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.52,0:16:12.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飘动得犹如乌鸦的翅膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flapping like the wings of a crow."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.45,0:16:12.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一块油布\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tarp?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.00,0:16:15.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  挂在车后窗  你就这样驶走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. on the rear window. and you drive it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.68,0:16:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许在细节上他的预测不太精准\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,he might be wrong about the details,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.11,0:16:18.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但结局却没出过什么错\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it doesn't mean he's wrong about the end result.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.84,0:16:19.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们只好夹着尾巴开溜\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're just gonna run?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.90,0:16:21.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在根本就还不够格\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are a long way from ready
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.88,0:16:24.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟莉莉丝面对面地硬碰硬\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a face-to-face death match with Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.69,0:16:30.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.19,0:16:36.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出什么问题了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What seems to be the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.51,0:16:37.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大桥现在不能通过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bridge is out ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.91,0:16:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只想离开这个小镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just trying to get out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.31,0:16:40.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.74,0:16:42.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-有其他路吗  -没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is there a detour? - nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.24,0:16:44.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有其他路通往高速公路了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not a side road that takes us to the highway?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.89,0:16:47.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要上高速  就得先过河\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get to the highway, you have to cross that river.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.46,0:16:49.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要过河  就得先过桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}To cross the river, you have to take that bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.37,0:16:50.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-河有多深  -抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How deep's the river? - sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.65,0:16:52.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕你俩不得不再在镇上留宿一晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afraid you boys are gonna have to spend the night in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.44,0:17:03.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  我有个妙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,this could be a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.36,0:17:07.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这将引导我们碰上莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,if this is what puts us on the path to Lilith,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.11,0:17:08.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就来个反其道而行之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then all we got to do is get off the path.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.96,0:17:09.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啥意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.87,0:17:11.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就像是本避免我们犯错的行为规范手册\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a blueprint of what not to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.67,0:17:13.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是说  手册指导我们向左走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,if the pages say that we go left --
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.54,0:17:15.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那我们就该向右走  -完全正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then we go right. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.49,0:17:18.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要反其道而行之  自然不会步入那个结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get off-book. we never make it to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.58,0:17:19.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今儿干脆反过来走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's opposite day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.32,0:17:22.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面说我们会大吵一架  那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says that we,uh, we get into a fight, so
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.65,0:17:23.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚决和平共处\N{\fnArial\fs30}No fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.73,0:17:25.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也别做调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}No research for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.29,0:17:27.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你也不能吃熏肉芝士汉堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}No bacon cheeseburger for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.80,0:17:29.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.49,0:17:31.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我点其他东西好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just order something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.59,0:17:33.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么推荐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi,uh, what's good?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.29,0:17:34.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你喜欢汉堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,if you like burgers,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.69,0:17:35.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥普拉的女朋友曾赞过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oprah's girlfriend said
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.67,0:17:38.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们这儿的熏肉芝士汉堡是全国最美味的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had the best bacon cheeseburgers in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.84,0:17:39.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.48,0:17:41.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请给我来份鸡肉色拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just have the cobb salad,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.65,0:17:48.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我要...素食豆腐汉堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have the... veggie tofu burger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.89,0:17:52.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.03,0:17:55.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这整件事太荒谬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole thing's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.27,0:17:56.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝也荒谬吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith is ridiculous?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.29,0:17:58.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我会跟她乱搞的构想就很荒谬\N{\fnArial\fs30}The idea of me hooking up with her is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.83,0:17:59.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.00,0:18:01.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为那种事绝不会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause something like that could never happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.88,0:18:07.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  这是我们第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, for the first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.97,0:18:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,获知莉莉丝即将到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have warning that Lilith is close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.27,0:18:13.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.39,0:18:14.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.15,0:18:16.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经占领了先机\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got the jump on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.28,0:18:19.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只需要在知道她现身的时间  地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we know when she's coming, we know where --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.57,0:18:21.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可是个千载难逢的良机\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.83,0:18:22.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.04,0:18:29.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你竟说出这么不计后果的话  真让我心凉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It frustrates me when you say such reckless things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.03,0:18:30.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也很心凉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,it frustrates me
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.49,0:18:32.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你情愿逃避也不愿正面迎战\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you'd rather hide than fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.65,0:18:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的鸡肉色拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cobb salad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.27,0:18:43.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的素食豆腐汉堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the tofu veggie burger for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.88,0:18:44.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.40,0:18:49.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是逃避  而是保存实力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not hiding. it's being smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.28,0:18:50.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这叫留着青山在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's picking your battles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.65,0:18:52.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们根本就还没做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is a battle that we are not ready to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.26,0:19:02.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.98,0:19:05.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太美味了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.04,0:19:07.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,豆腐真是超美味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tofu is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.20,0:19:09.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.35,0:19:11.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你错拿成了熏肉芝士汉堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you the bacon cheeseburger by mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.07,0:19:17.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斗牛士汽车旅馆
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.46,0:19:18.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有空房
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.81,0:19:27.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大佬  这儿可是按时收费的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude,this place charges by the hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.19,0:19:28.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道  手册上说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,well, the book says
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.22,0:19:29.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝在一家叫红的汽车旅馆找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith finds you at the red motel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.79,0:19:31.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  妓女客栈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hence,the,uh, hooker inn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.45,0:19:32.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反过来走走  还记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's opposite day, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.01,0:19:45.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.28,0:19:47.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放一些防范莉莉丝的符咒袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of hex bags ought to Lilith-proof the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.82,0:19:50.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我  是要整晚就都窝这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,what? I'm supposed to just hole up here all night?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.23,0:19:51.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖乖照做  知道了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's exactly what you're gonna do,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.36,0:19:52.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万别调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no research.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.55,0:19:54.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不介意你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what you do --
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.51,0:19:55.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是想活动下你的魔力手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use the magic fingers
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.71,0:19:58.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是看付费的《色情之家》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or watch "casa erotica" on pay-per-view.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.91,0:20:03.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大佬  别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,dude,come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.97,0:20:05.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是以防万一罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just call it insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.21,0:20:09.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你准备干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.61,0:20:11.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,书上说我一整天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,the pages say that I spend all day
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.03,0:20:12.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都驾着黑羚羊兜风  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riding around in the Impala. so
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.65,0:20:13.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就去好好安置她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna go park her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖一点  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behave yourself, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.97,0:20:19.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不想叫服务小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}No homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.40,0:20:20.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就看看色情片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch some porn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.55,0:20:39.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斗牛士
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.10,0:20:41.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.27,0:21:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.46,0:21:16.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.62,0:21:20.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢你能来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.78,0:21:21.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.64,0:21:28.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道你知道多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just wondering how much you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.76,0:21:30.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}About me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.76,0:21:31.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.79,0:21:34.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有预见到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen visions of me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.27,0:21:37.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在没有迪恩的那段期间的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I'm not with Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.14,0:21:42.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是问我是否知道恶魔之血的事儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to know if I know about the demon blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.59,0:21:45.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没告诉迪恩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't tell Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.26,0:21:48.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我压根就没写过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't even write it into the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.72,0:21:51.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怕让你显得很冷血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was afraid it would make you look unsympathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.91,0:21:54.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-冷血吗  -当然了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Unsympathetic? - yeah,come on,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.82,0:21:56.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可是吸血呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,sucking blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.84,0:21:58.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你心知肚明那很邪恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to know that's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.81,0:22:09.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It scares the hell out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.57,0:22:14.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我清楚那份邪恶在我体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I feel it inside of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.10,0:22:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  真希望自己能抑制对它的渴望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...I wish to god I could stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.71,0:22:19.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你又总是依赖于它\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you keep going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.89,0:22:22.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还能怎样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What choice have I got?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.43,0:22:25.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果那能帮我杀了莉莉丝  阻止天启降世的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it helps me kill Lilith and stop the apocalypse --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.94,0:22:27.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直以为那是迪恩的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that was Dean's job.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.62,0:22:29.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使们不也是这么说的  不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what the angels say,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.48,0:22:30.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩已不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.57,0:22:35.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如今的他已经不复从前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...he's not Dean lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.82,0:22:37.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自他从地狱回来后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever since he got out of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.98,0:22:40.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就需要我从旁帮他一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.32,0:22:43.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你就担起了他的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you got to carry the weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.09,0:22:44.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从小到大都是他在照顾我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's looked after me my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.63,0:22:47.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就不能回报他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't return the favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.18,0:22:48.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,sure you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.94,0:22:52.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  如果真这么简单的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean if that's what this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.54,0:22:55.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然还会是怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else would it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.55,0:22:57.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说不上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.38,0:23:01.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许恶魔之血确实让你变强大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the demon blood makes you feel stronger?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.78,0:23:03.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让你更有驾驭之欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}More in control?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.91,0:23:08.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.49,0:23:10.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.12,0:23:15.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.98,0:23:18.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这是个沉重的负担\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's a terrible burden --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.97,0:23:20.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉得一切都寄托在你身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeling that it all rests on your shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.00,0:23:21.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.15,0:23:25.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切真都寄托在我身上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All rest on my shoulders?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.69,0:23:29.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,故事的发展来看是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That seems to be where the story's headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.17,0:23:35.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我强大到今晚就能阻止莉莉丝了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I strong enough to stop Lilith tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.41,0:23:37.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.14,0:23:41.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还看不到那么远\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen that far yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.99,0:23:46.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  别紧张  你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god. just be take easy. you'll be OKay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.92,0:23:50.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-星星  -你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stars. - what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.75,0:23:55.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真抱歉  刚才没看见你  你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry. I just didn't see you. are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.42,0:24:02.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有  对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sorry about...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.70,0:24:04.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.05,0:24:07.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我女儿喜欢假扮医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}M-my daughter's going through a doctor phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.94,0:24:09.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.33,0:24:10.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在好多啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.37,0:24:15.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,no...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.79,0:25:00.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.43,0:25:02.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你早知道我会来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it you knew I'd be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.28,0:25:03.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.94,0:25:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我被辆卡车给撞了  恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's 'cause I just got hit by a minivan, Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.36,0:25:12.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.16,0:25:15.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每件你写的有关我的事都成真了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every damn thing you write about me comes true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.40,0:25:16.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只 "噢"一句就完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all you have to say is "oh"?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.65,0:25:18.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别对我吼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't yell at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.10,0:25:19.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我总觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do I get feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.71,0:25:21.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有事瞒着我们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something that you're not telling us?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.29,0:25:22.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有什么好瞒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What wouldn't I be telling you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.12,0:25:23.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道那些的  从头说起\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you know what you know, for starters!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.86,0:25:25.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道原因  就是知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how I know. I just do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.71,0:25:27.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这答案我不太满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.74,0:25:29.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你他妈是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell are you doing this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.12,0:25:30.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  放开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.20,0:25:35.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是受庇护之士\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man is to be protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.40,0:25:37.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出于什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.95,0:25:39.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是上帝的先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a prophet of the lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.14,0:25:54.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.96,0:25:56.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're castiel...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.98,0:25:58.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.80,0:26:00.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很荣幸见到你  恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an honor to meet you, Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.76,0:26:04.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很钦佩你的成果\N{\fnArial\fs30}I admire your work
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.76,0:26:10.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊  这家伙  是个先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa,whoa,what? this guy,a prophet?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.44,0:26:11.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  他  他...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on,he's -- he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.68,0:26:13.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他根本就是个顾影弄姿小作家罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's practically a penthouse forum writer!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.24,0:26:16.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你早就知道自己是先知对不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.93,0:26:19.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  貌似确实有梦到过吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I,uh, I might have dreamt about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.25,0:26:20.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你却不告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you didn't tell us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.47,0:26:22.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也太荒谬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was too preposterous.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.48,0:26:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更别说还很自负\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to mention arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.17,0:26:26.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把自己写进书里就算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,writing yourself into the story is one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.01,0:26:27.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还写成个先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as a prophet?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.22,0:26:29.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那根本就是夜郎自大的表现嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's like m. night-level douchiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.52,0:26:32.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是决定我们命运的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the guy who decides our fate?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.27,0:26:33.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他啥也决定不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He isn't deciding anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.67,0:26:35.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只是个代言人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a mouthpiece --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.34,0:26:37.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是道出圣言的人罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A conduit for the inspired word.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.63,0:26:39.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,圣言\N{\fnArial\fs30}The word?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.40,0:26:41.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝的圣言吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The word of god?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.72,0:26:44.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跟我说这是一本全新的新约圣经\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, like the new new testament?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.35,0:26:45.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总有一天  这些书\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day,these books --
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.74,0:26:48.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会被称为温彻斯特福音而广为流传的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be known as the winchester gospel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.83,0:26:50.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你开玩笑的吧  -你开玩笑的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got to be kidding me. - you got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.74,0:26:54.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有...  开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not... kidding you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.71,0:27:01.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以的话  我先闪人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'd both please excuse me one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.72,0:27:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就他  真的假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him? really?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.14,0:27:11.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是见过路加的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've seen Luke.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.49,0:27:17.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么会选他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd he get tapped?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.39,0:27:21.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道先知都是怎么选出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how prophets are chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.13,0:27:27.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是由高等级天使下令挑选的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The order comes from high up on the celestial ch command
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.09,0:27:29.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-多高的  -非常高\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How high? - very.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.66,0:27:32.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便吧  那我们怎么解决这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,whatever. how do we get around this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.74,0:27:34.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解决什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Around what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.74,0:27:36.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆-莉莉丝的爱之深接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Sam-Lilith love connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.27,0:27:37.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要怎样阻止来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we stop it from happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.20,0:27:43.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先知所写的绝非儿戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the prophet has written can't be unwritten.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.97,0:27:49.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然他已经看到了  就一定会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}As he has seen it, so it shall come to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.39,0:28:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.51,0:28:10.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  我们离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. we're getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.67,0:28:11.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? where?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.93,0:28:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anywhere,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.01,0:28:14.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开这个旅馆  离开这个镇子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of this motel, out of this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.75,0:28:16.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又算是用游的  我们也要游走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care if we got to swim, we are getting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.75,0:28:25.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老弟  那些该死的符咒包呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude,where are all the hex bags?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.66,0:28:27.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被我烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I burned them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.52,0:28:29.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干了啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.30,0:28:31.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  如果莉莉丝真会来  不管这可能性有多大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,if Lilith is coming, which is a big "if"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.79,0:28:33.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  不  莉莉丝是真的要来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no,no. it's more than an "if."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.13,0:28:36.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恰克不是什么通灵者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck is not a psychic.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.99,0:28:38.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-而是个先知  -啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's a prophet. - what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.63,0:28:39.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥现身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass showed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.33,0:28:42.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并告诉我说  恰克所写的正是你我的福音录\N{\fnArial\fs30}And apparently chuck is writing the gospel of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.59,0:28:46.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.62,0:28:48.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好  我们立马走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. let's get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.16,0:28:52.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.89,0:28:55.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝会宰了你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith is gonna slaughter you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.60,0:28:57.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定她不会  或是根本办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she will, maybe she won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.14,0:28:58.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以呢  你觉得自己能反过来宰了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what? you think you can take her?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.53,0:28:59.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要知道答案的唯一方法  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one way to find out, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.71,0:29:00.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是让她放马过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I say bring her on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.45,0:29:02.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  -你不相信我  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam... - you think I'll do it, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.66,0:29:04.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我会选择堕落\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'll go dark side.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.91,0:29:06.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  行了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! okay? yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.99,0:29:08.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧你最近的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way you've been acting lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.30,0:29:10.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干得那些事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}The things you've been doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.40,0:29:12.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我都知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.62,0:29:15.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如你杀阿拉斯泰尔时  如何得不费吹灰之力\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you ripped Alastair apart like it was nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.33,0:29:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像拍死了一只苍蝇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you were swatting a fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.92,0:29:21.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西都跟我说的  行了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass told me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.81,0:29:22.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还跟你说了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else did he tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.91,0:29:24.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是我不知道的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing I don't already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.30,0:29:26.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如你正在使用自己的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you've been using your psychic crap,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.66,0:29:27.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且你也变得越来越强了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you've been getting stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.78,0:29:29.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是不清楚何以这样  也不知你如何办到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just don't know why, and we don't know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.39,0:29:30.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不是你想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.41,0:29:31.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你说说看啊  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what is it, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.99,0:29:33.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在是一头雾水\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I'm at a total loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.17,0:29:52.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不要跟我一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you coming or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.08,0:29:56.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.01,0:30:23.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  虽然我觉得这么做很傻  但\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I feel stupid doing this. but
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.36,0:30:27.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am fresh out of options.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.82,0:30:29.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,please...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.47,0:30:32.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.63,0:30:37.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在祈祷  听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm praying, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.27,0:30:39.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现身吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.68,0:30:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.98,0:30:44.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祈祷是信仰的一种表现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prayer is a sign of faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.30,0:30:48.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是件好事  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a good thing, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.02,0:30:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么你是愿意帮我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So does that mean you'll help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.31,0:30:54.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该怎么帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.68,0:30:56.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上带萨姆离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drag Sam out of here -- now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.20,0:30:57.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在莉莉丝现身前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before Lilith shows up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.45,0:30:58.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可是个预言\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a prophecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.84,0:31:01.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't interfere.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.61,0:31:06.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你用尽各种方法不断考验我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have tested me and thrown me every which way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.05,0:31:10.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我从没要求什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have never asked for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.01,0:31:12.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一次都没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.35,0:31:15.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在我请求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I'm asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.26,0:31:17.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.51,0:31:19.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.80,0:31:24.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的请求  它\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you're asking,it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.69,0:31:27.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超出了我的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not within my power to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.41,0:31:29.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么  就因为那是上帝的预言  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why? 'cause it's "divine prophecy"? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.47,0:31:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道我们就该坐以待毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,what -- we're just supposed to sit around
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.71,0:31:32.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仍其发展吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-and wait for it to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.59,0:31:37.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.81,0:31:43.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见你的鬼去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.90,0:31:45.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以及你那鬼任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.01,0:31:47.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有你那上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your god.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.34,0:31:49.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你现在不帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't help me now,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.35,0:31:53.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次你需要我的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then when the time comes and you need me...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.29,0:31:56.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就别再来找我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...don't bother knocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.34,0:32:00.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.19,0:32:02.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.15,0:32:03.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.72,0:32:09.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得了解清楚为什么我不能插手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must understand why I can't intercede.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.71,0:32:11.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先知们非常特别  他们受神庇护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prophets are very special. they're protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.74,0:32:12.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.40,0:32:17.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有任何威胁  无论是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anything threatens a prophet, anything at all,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.64,0:32:20.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大天使都会现身  将其铲除\N{\fnArial\fs30}An archangel will appear to destroy that threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.73,0:32:22.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大天使们都异常的暴戾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archangels are fierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.04,0:32:24.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且六亲不认\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.44,0:32:27.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是天堂里最可怕的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're heaven's most terrifying weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.66,0:32:31.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而正是这些大天使  保护着先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these archangels, they're tied to prophets?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.59,0:32:32.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.90,0:32:39.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果先知和恶魔共处一室的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if a prophet was in the Same room as a demon --
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.50,0:32:41.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么可怕的天堂之怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the most fearsome wrath of heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.10,0:32:42.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会降临到恶魔身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would rain down on that demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.03,0:32:49.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想让你明白  为什么我帮不了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so you understand... why I can't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.64,0:32:56.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.39,0:32:57.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.65,0:33:03.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这儿干嘛呢  我没写过这一出啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here? I didn't write this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.67,0:33:04.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.96,0:33:05.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你跟我一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.81,0:33:07.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  去哪  -去萨姆在的那个汽车旅馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? where? - to the motel where Sam is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.72,0:33:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝也在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where Lilith is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.61,0:33:10.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  没错  我就是找你帮忙阻止她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, exactly. I need you to stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.44,0:33:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了吗  那可是莉莉丝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you insane? Lilith?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.41,0:33:15.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我清楚她的能力  我写过她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what she's capable of, Dean -- I wrote her.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.39,0:33:16.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了  你听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.03,0:33:19.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有一个大天使守护着  明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have an archangel tethered to you,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.47,0:33:21.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只需到那儿露个脸  让大天使爆发一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you got to do is show up and boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.94,0:33:23.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝就玩儿完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith gets smoked.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.15,0:33:25.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  我  我从没预见那一出啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I-I-I haven't seen that yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.57,0:33:26.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-the story --
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.08,0:33:28.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恰克  你可是我的救命稻草呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck, you're the only shot that I've got left.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.61,0:33:29.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.45,0:33:31.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是一个作家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a writer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.50,0:33:33.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这已经不再是个故事了  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a story anymore,man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.77,0:33:36.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经木已成舟  你也逃脱不了干系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is real! and you're in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.71,0:33:40.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  我希望你能奋力一搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I need you to get off your ass and fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.87,0:33:48.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on,chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.59,0:33:51.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没门\N{\fnArial\fs30}No friggin' way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.96,0:33:54.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那么  要不这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,well,then, how about this --
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.29,0:33:55.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我口袋里正躺着一把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a gun in my pocket,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.94,0:33:58.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不跟我走  我就爆了你的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you don't come with me, I'll blow your brains out.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.10,0:34:01.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得你说过有大天使守护着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said I was protected by an archangel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.91,0:34:04.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个理由不错嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, interesting exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.96,0:34:06.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就看看谁更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see who the quicker draw is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.33,0:34:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,勿扰
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.00,0:34:28.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.02,0:34:31.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.94,0:34:41.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆 刀在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}where is the knife, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.30,0:34:44.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在床头柜那\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the nightstand. by the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.35,0:35:07.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就只有这点儿小伎俩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to try a lot harder than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.16,0:35:08.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尝尝这个怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How 'bout this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.64,0:35:17.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你变强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.16,0:35:19.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过还不够强\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not that strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.38,0:35:20.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差得还远呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.52,0:35:21.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你干嘛不把我扔走\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't you throw me around then?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.82,0:35:24.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我办不到  你心知肚明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I can't and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.20,0:35:28.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你早对我的魔力免疫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're immune to my charms.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.12,0:35:31.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们势均力敌啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems we're at a stalemate.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.44,0:35:32.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.65,0:35:34.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}To talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.72,0:35:37.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我没兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,well, I'm not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.83,0:35:42.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使我自愿从封印之战中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if i'm offering to stand down...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.38,0:35:45.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,退出\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the seals...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.50,0:35:48.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}The apocalypse...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.70,0:35:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.91,0:35:51.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还期待我会相信你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You expect me to believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.36,0:35:53.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说真的  没想过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly? no.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.22,0:35:56.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可没那么好唬弄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were always the smart one.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.80,0:35:58.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这次是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.28,0:36:01.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以终止这一切  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can end it,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.40,0:36:03.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就此时  此地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here,right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.93,0:36:05.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会停止打破封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stop breaking seals,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.49,0:36:08.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让路西法在笼子里腐烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer keeps rotting in his cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.77,0:36:11.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要你答应我的条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to do is agree to my terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.59,0:36:13.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么要放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you back down?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.49,0:36:14.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么偏挑这个时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.23,0:36:18.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后的结果是  我无法在这场战争中幸免\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turns out, I don't survive this war.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.93,0:36:25.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要终结  就应该从源头下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killed off, right before the good part starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.44,0:36:26.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你究竟想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.77,0:36:29.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了能重回旧秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}For it to go back to the way it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.73,0:36:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我被天使们夺命索魂前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I had angels to deal with 24/7.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.55,0:36:35.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那美好的往日\N{\fnArial\fs30}The good old days,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.47,0:36:39.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天都沐浴在婴儿的鲜血之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it was all baby blood all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.16,0:36:41.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那代价呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do you want in return?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.16,0:36:43.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的项上人头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your head on a stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.63,0:36:46.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有迪恩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.25,0:36:50.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就当是个安慰奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it a consolation prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.95,0:36:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do you say, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.08,0:36:57.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温彻斯特家族不是最爱自我牺牲的  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Self-sacrifice is the winchester way, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.68,0:37:00.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还真的以为我会蠢到相信你的鬼话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think I'm stupid enough to fall for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.88,0:37:02.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你交易了  我就必须得遵守\N{\fnArial\fs30}I make a deal, I have to follow through.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.63,0:37:05.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是规矩啊  你清楚得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are the rules, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.70,0:37:09.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你真妄自尊大到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you really so arrogant
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.04,0:37:10.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把自己的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you would put your life
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.13,0:37:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看得比60亿无辜的人的命还重要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the lives of 6 billion innocent people?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.75,0:37:18.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是你体内的恶魔之血在作祟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's all that demon blood pumping through your pipes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.05,0:37:21.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一点真是合我的心意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man after my own heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.02,0:37:24.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我跟你志趣相投\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.48,0:37:27.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你没有任何共同点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am nothing like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.54,0:37:29.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就证明给我看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then prove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.38,0:37:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有第一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going once.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.25,0:37:36.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总会有第二次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.99,0:37:38.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.25,0:37:42.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.26,0:37:47.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便说一下  跟我做交易不单单只是个吻\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way,a contract with me will take more than a kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.96,0:37:49.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要做得更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot more.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.91,0:37:53.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.41,0:37:55.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我附身的这位牙医小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dental hygienist in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.09,0:37:58.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她想这事都想疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wants it bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.03,0:38:40.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是先知恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the prophet Chuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.82,0:38:44.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to be joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.55,0:38:47.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是在开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is no joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.04,0:38:50.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看吧  恰克有大天使的守护\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, Chuck here's got an archangel on his shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.16,0:38:55.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有10秒钟可逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got about 10 seconds
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.06,0:38:56.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这间屋子充满了天堂之怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before this room is full of wrath
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.84,0:38:58.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你震成灰烬之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're a piece of charcoal.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.73,0:39:00.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真想继续纠缠下去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure you want to tangle with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.04,0:39:37.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}so a deal,ha
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.68,0:39:39.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.29,0:39:40.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了要终结一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}To call the whole thing off --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.66,0:39:43.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使  封印  路西法的复出  所有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels, Seals, Lucifer rising, the whole nine?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.57,0:39:44.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the gist of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.04,0:39:50.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.72,0:39:52.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就没心动一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't think once about taking it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.27,0:39:53.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.05,0:39:59.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你花了一整天来说服我远离莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You spent all day trying to talk me off the Lilith track.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.47,0:40:00.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想提醒下你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.79,0:40:03.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她可能真找到什么方法终结这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}She would have found some way to weasel out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.05,0:40:05.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许就是要我们作出牺牲就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all it would have cost us was our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.11,0:40:07.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊  也许你说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.06,0:40:09.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但无论如何  这都不是重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway. that's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.56,0:40:10.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那重点是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.35,0:40:11.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重点是  她在害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point is, she's scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.06,0:40:14.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.63,0:40:17.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝在逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith is running.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.55,0:40:20.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么要逃跑  -不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Running from what? - don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.90,0:40:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是她透露了一个事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she was telling the truth about one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.71,0:40:24.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.63,0:40:28.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天启降世她也无法幸存\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not gonna survive the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.72,0:40:30.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会弄个水落石出的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.22,0:40:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.87,0:40:53.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.63,0:40:55.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是撒迦利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm zachariah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.97,0:40:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从你的作品里应该认识我了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may know me from your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.78,0:41:00.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.66,0:41:02.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.10,0:41:07.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.17,0:41:10.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那一切  真的会发生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is all of that... really going to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.51,0:41:14.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以前有错过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you been wrong so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.84,0:41:17.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得马上去警告萨姆和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to warn Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.96,0:41:19.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我建议你别去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't advise it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.96,0:41:24.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候对自己命运不用知之甚详\N{\fnArial\fs30}People shouldn't know too much about their own destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.19,0:41:28.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以试试看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You try...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.68,0:41:31.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会阻止你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.55,0:41:38.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.45,0:41:39.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}To go kill myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.96,0:41:41.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别那么琼瑶嘛  恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be Melodramatic, Chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.77,0:41:45.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只会再把你救活的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd only bring you back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.43,0:41:54.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.15,0:41:57.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一如既往\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.34,0:41:59.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,写下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Write.
